WEBVTT

00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:16.527
You have a traitor in your midst, Aslan.
你们之间有一个叛徒 亚斯蓝

00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:18.807
(PEOPLE MURMURING)

00:00:19.487 --> 00:00:22.087
His offence was not against you.
他背叛的并不是你

00:00:23.007 --> 00:00:25.847
Have you forgotten the laws
upon which Narnia was built?
你忘了纳尼亚得以建国的律法

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:29.207
(GROWLS) Do not cite
the Deep Magic to me, Witch.
别跟我引述高深魔法 女巫

00:00:29.807 --> 00:00:32.127
I was there when it was written.
魔法制定时我也在场

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:37.967
Then you'll remember well
that every traitor belongs to me.
那你就应该清楚地记得
每个叛徒都属于我

00:00:39.607 --> 00:00:41.647
His blood is my property.
他的鲜血归我所有

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:44.287
Try and take him then.
那你就来拿拿看吧

00:00:47.607 --> 00:00:51.407
Do you really think that mere force
will deny me my right,
你真的以为仅凭武力
就能剥夺我的权利…

00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:54.407
little King?
…小国王？

00:00:57.327 --> 00:01:01.047
Aslan knows that unless I have blood,
as the law demands,
亚斯蓝很清楚
除非我依照律法得到他的鲜血

00:01:01.207 --> 00:01:04.007
all of Narnia will be overturned
不然整个纳尼亚将会在…

00:01:04.527 --> 00:01:07.727
and perish in fire and water.
…烈火与洪水之中覆灭

00:01:07.887 --> 00:01:10.167
That boy will die
那孩子将会…

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:12.647
on the Stone Table,
…死在石桌之上

00:01:16.407 --> 00:01:18.247
as is tradition.
这是传统

00:01:21.087 --> 00:01:23.007
You dare not refuse me.
你不敢拒绝我的

00:01:24.047 --> 00:01:25.447
Enough.
够了

00:01:28.527 --> 00:01:30.727
I shall talk with you alone.
我要跟你单独谈谈

00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:56.287
(PEOPLE MURMURING)

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:27.167
She has renounced her claim
on the Son of Adam's blood.
她不再要求得到
亚当儿子的鲜血

00:02:27.327 --> 00:02:28.607
(ALL CHEERING)

00:02:28.767 --> 00:02:31.287
How do I know
your promise will be kept?
我怎么知道你会守信呢？

00:02:31.487 --> 00:02:33.447
(ROARING)

00:02:34.127 --> 00:02:36.287
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:03:14.447 --> 00:03:16.567
(LUCY SIGHING)

00:03:18.127 --> 00:03:20.047
(DISTANT FOOTSTEPS)

00:03:24.967 --> 00:03:25.967
(WHISPERING) Susan!
苏珊

00:03:26.167 --> 00:03:27.167
Mmm?

00:04:17.247 --> 00:04:19.527
Shouldn't you both be in bed?
你们俩应该躺在床上才对

00:04:22.767 --> 00:04:24.527
We couldn't sleep.
我们睡不着

00:04:26.087 --> 00:04:27.727
Please, Aslan.
求求你 亚斯蓝

00:04:29.007 --> 00:04:30.687
Couldn't we come with you?
我们能跟你一起去吗？

00:04:30.847 --> 00:04:33.727
I would be glad
of the company for a while.
如果你们能陪我一小会儿
我会很高兴

00:04:35.527 --> 00:04:37.007
Thank you.
谢谢你们

00:05:01.407 --> 00:05:03.167
It is time.
时候到了

00:05:03.327 --> 00:05:06.327
From here, I must go on alone.
从这里开始
我必须一个人过去

00:05:06.487 --> 00:05:07.487
But Aslan...
可是 亚斯蓝…

00:05:07.647 --> 00:05:11.167
You have to trust me.
For this must be done.
你们得相信我
因为这是必须要做的

00:05:12.127 --> 00:05:13.927
Thank you, Susan.
谢谢你 苏珊

00:05:14.367 --> 00:05:16.047
Thank you, Lucy.
谢谢你 露西

00:05:16.487 --> 00:05:17.967
And farewell.
再见了

00:05:30.327 --> 00:05:31.327
(SIGHS)

00:05:41.967 --> 00:05:43.447
(SQUEALING)

00:05:51.927 --> 00:05:54.047
(GROWLING)

00:06:00.647 --> 00:06:02.407
(SCREECHING)

